"\n\n\n\n\n## Ordered\n\n\n## Review\nVisited on the recommendation of our tour guide.  \nIt was my first time having Greek food, so I had no idea what to order — I just went with the guide's suggestions: Souvlaki and Homemade Moussaka.\n\nThe Souvlaki was like a Greek-style kebab — lamb wrapped in pita bread.  \nThe lamb was tender and really good.\n\nThe Moussaka had a layered structure like lasagna, with a surprisingly strong mashed potato flavour.  \nIt was unlike anything I'd tasted before, but I enjoyed it without any hesitation.\n\nOverall a satisfying meal.\n## Pictures\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"